identicon (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Generate kaleidoscope, wavatar, monsterid, retro, and robo avatars
    from a UTF-8 ID.
  * Add CLI flags for salt, output file, type, format, size, background
    color, and force overwrite.
  * Give identicon geometric tiles with left-right symmetry instead of
    fat-pixel upscale.
  * Scale retro face detail with output size (16/32/64/128/256).
  * Vary robo limbs, faces, and antennas; keep arms attached and belly
    details inside the body.
  * Satisfy zfr lint: split renderers, rename runtime helpers, locale
    man pages, RPM noarch, and CI scripts.

 -- Lenik (谢继雷) <lenik@bodz.net>  Tue, 06 Oct 2026 17:15:05 +0800

